<title>USA: CVS Corp Nov same-store sales up 14.7 pct.</title>
<headline>CVS Corp Nov same-store sales up 14.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WOONSOCKET, R.I. 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $444.0     $376.5     +17.9	+14.7</p>
<p>Year-to-date  $4,860.0   $4,240.0     +14.5	+11.1</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>This year's November sales results do not include Thanksgiving.</p>
<p>    Month is   four weeks ended	Nov. 23.</p>
<p>Full company name is CVS Corp.</p>
